# SECTION-BY-SECTION SPEC (keep this exact order; each section is its own component with a semantic landmark and an id for anchor links)

## 1. Header + Hero (id="home")
Header is absolutely/fixed-positioned OVER the hero, never a separate bar above it.
- Left: NOMIRA logo mark (simple geometric "N" built from two interlocking shapes, inline SVG, white) + wordmark "NOMIRA" in Bricolage Grotesque, semibold, white.
- Centre: a rounded capsule (dark translucent rgba(20,20,20,.35) with backdrop-blur 8-12px, 1px rgba(255,255,255,.12) border) containing: Destinations, Experiences, Deals, Guides, About, Contact. Poppins 13-14px white; the active/current item is a white pill with dark text. Active state follows the section in view (IntersectionObserver) or hover/click.
- Right: white "Sign up" pill (dark text). It opens a small accessible demo dialog or scrolls to the newsletter; it must DO something (state this clearly in the dialog as a demo, no real auth).
- Mobile (<lg): hide the capsule. Show logo + hamburger button (aria-expanded, aria-controls, aria-label). Open a full-height or large sheet panel with the six links stacked, large tap targets (min 48px), Sign up button at the bottom, focus trapped while open, Escape and link-click close it, body scroll locked while open. Links are real anchors with smooth scroll to section ids.
- Header becomes a solid near-black translucent bar with the same layout after scrolling past the hero (subtle, GSAP or CSS), so it stays legible on white sections.

Hero:
- Rounded photographic block (inset by gutter, radius ~24px), height clamp(560px, 92svh, 860px), min-height respects mobile browser bars (use svh).
- Photo: hot-air balloons floating over a rocky, warm-toned canyon landscape at dusk/dawn (Cappadocia-like), natural colour, cinematic. Subject: balloons in the upper half, rock formations lower. Use object-fit cover with object-position about 50% 35% so balloons stay visible on mobile crops. Hero image is eager-loaded with fetchpriority="high".
- Overlay: subtle dark gradient (about rgba(0,0,0,.15) top to rgba(0,0,0,.45) bottom). Photo must stay visible.
- H1 (centered, white, display font): "Find your next unforgettable trip", balanced line breaks (text-wrap: balance), roughly two lines on desktop ("Find your next" / "unforgettable trip").
- Supporting copy (Poppins, white at ~85%): "Discover hidden gems, chill spots, and wild adventures, all in one place."
- Search bar, ONE cohesive pill (dark translucent like the nav capsule, max-width about 760px, centred): four segments separated by thin vertical dividers:
  1. [map-pin icon] "Where to next" text input (with visible label for screen readers)
  2. [calendar icon] "Pick your dates" button opening a small popover with two native date inputs (Check-in, Check-out), validating that check-out is after check-in
