- Hero bottom transition: the photo dissolves into the white page via a soft, feathered, gently curved/elliptical edge (implement with a CSS mask or radial-gradient ellipse about 8-12% of hero height, with a feathered edge). This is a judgement call from the reference: tune it visually so it looks smooth, not like a hard cut.

